{{header effects}}
{{disambig msg|effects which can be inflicted on [[monster]]s|the different kinds of effects which Isaac's primary weapon can have|Tear Effects}}

'''Status effects''' are special effects that can be inflicted on an [[enemy]] from a variety of sources, such as tears, {{e|Bomb}}s, and [[item]]s. Each status effect has a color and/or symbol/effect associated with them for easy identification. These colorations are not to be confused with [[champion]]s. Status effects are often temporary, but can become permanent in certain circumstances.

